.DS_Store
*.DS_Store
~$*

# Large media & data assets live in the sz_RECIPE_repo Google Drive, not git.
# (Recipe outcome images are the exception - they're small and live in
# recipes/images/, tracked, so recipes render on GitHub.)
ingredients/*
videos/
hero/

# Exception: the Customer 360 ingredient set is small, synthetic, and linked
# directly from its recipe, so it ships in the repo. (Note the pattern above
# must be `ingredients/*`, not `ingredients/`, or git never descends far
# enough to see this negation.)
!ingredients/customer360/
